  "details": "Friend list at [Friends Only] Instance is not unified between UIs (Quick menu and detail menu) and browser.\nAt client UI:\n  - If you are not in Friends Instance and NOT joined previously, the list will only shows the instance owner.\n    -- At this situation, a friend in that instance will show as 'User is in Private' at profile detail menu, even if instance owner is your friend.\n  - If you are in Friends Instance, all friends in the instance will be shown.\n  - If you are not in Friends Instance but joined previously (and instance owner is your friend), it will show all friends in the instance. (it seems weird)\n    -- At this situation, a friend in that instance will show its instance at profile detail menu.\nAt Web browser:\n  - All friends in the instance will shown regardless of your current location (if instance owner is your friend).",
